- The head can also be moved **out of the capture** entirely: capture the
  pre-head hidden state and apply the head offline. On this lane that is
  measurably equivalent to storing logits — mean `KL(live || replayed)`
  `{{MEAN}}`, top-1 agreement `{{TOP1}}`, panel-mean shift `{{PANEL_DELTA}}`
  over {{RUNS}} bitwise-identical cold runs — which is what licenses a
  {{HIDDEN_MB}} MB same-lane teacher in place of {{LOGITS_GIB}} GiB of logits.
  The qualification is per-stack, not universal: see `k6/HIDDEN-REPLAY.md`.
